{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "roadmap": "E11-T02",
  "description": "blok check, test and inspect run against real scaffolded applications (module example.com/shop) after these edits. Placeholders: {module} is the module path, {node} the quote node's directory in the layout, {nodes} the directory holding the layout's Go nodes. outputRecords counts passed checks (check), passed tests (test) or catalog entries (inspect); errorRecords counts diagnostics; effectRecords counts project files the command created, changed or removed.",
